# TODO: uncomment and fill once GitHub Pages or a docs site exists
# url: "https://TODO-ORG.github.io/RSDTK/"
abstract: >-
  RSDTK is a desktop application for batch converting satellite and airborne
  remote sensing data into analysis-ready GeoTIFF and ENVI formats. It supports
  14 sensor families and over 30 product types, handling per-product calibration
  and scaling, swath reprojection, GLT orthorectification, spatial and spectral
  subsetting, and the writing of ENVI headers with wavelength metadata. RSDTK is
  intended to reduce the preprocessing burden in multi-sensor remote sensing
  research and teaching, with particular attention to thermal infrared
  applications.
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - thermal infrared
  - hyperspectral
  - data preprocessing
  - GeoTIFF
  - ENVI
  - ASTER
  - ECOSTRESS
  - EMIT
  - volcanology
  - geoscience education
